{lalitāgamaḥ}

(saṃprokṣaṇavidhimātram)


<p. 1>

|| [saṃprokṣaṇam] ||

[lalitāgame saṃprokṣaṇavidhiḥ] ||

kālī ca dakṣiṇe caiva pūjayettu krameṇa tu |
dakṣiṇadvāravāme tu bhṛṅgiṇe tu samarcayet || 1 ||

gaṇeśaṃ dakṣiṇe bhāge tanmānañca yajedbudhaḥ |
paścimadvāravāme tu vṛṣabhāya namontakam || 2 ||

skandasya dakṣiṇe bhāge skandeśāya namo namaḥ |
uttaradvāravāme tu gaurīñcaiva tu pūjayet || 3 ||

taddakṣiṇāya caṇḍeśaṃ namontādimiti smṛtam |
tattaddhyānamanusmṛtya arcayettu gurottamaḥ || 4 ||

paścimadvāravāme tu mahālakṣmīṃ prapūjayet |
tatvadṛṣṭyā viśeṣeṇākṣepamatha śāstrakaiḥ || 5 ||

pā (* *) ta viśeṣeṇa vighnoccāṭanakarmaṇi |
ghaṇṭāntu tāḍayeddhīmān tri (*) kāraṃ yathā kuru || 6 ||

iti dvārāṇi saṃ (*) pya paścimadvāramāviśet |
dehālyamadhyame caiva astramantrāṇi pūjayet || 7 ||

vāstubrahmaviśeṣeṇa tanmantreṇa samarcayet |
yāgamaṇṭapakaṃ pūrve bhūmitatvena pūjayet || 8 ||

<p. 2>

jalatatve namontañca tṛṇānāṃ pūjayettataḥ |
agnitatve namontañca bandheṣu yajanaṃ kramāt || 9 ||

vāyutatve namontañca vaṃśānāṃ pūjayettataḥ |
namamākāśatatvañca sthūṇānāṃ pūjayettataḥ || 10 ||

candrāya yajanañcaiva vidhānena supūjayet |
vāsukāyāṃ namontañca darbhamālā supūjayet || 11 ||

pūrvādīni samārabhya darpaṇaṃ pūrṇakumbhayoḥ |
tannāmnena samabhyarcya pādyādīnyupacārakaiḥ || 12 ||

vṛṣabhaṃ cāmarañcaivā tannāmne (ca) supūjayet |
śrīvatsaṃ svastikañcaiva tannāmneti pūjayet || 13 ||

śaṃkhadīpena kartavyaṃ pūjayettu svanāmataḥ |
evaṃ krameṇa saṃpūjya śuddhatatvena bhāvayet || 14 ||

ātmadaivatamabhyarcya viśeṣārghyañca kalpayet |
astreṇa dravyaśuddhiñca ātmānaṃ pūjayettataḥ || 15 ||

svadakṣiṇe pā (* * * * *) ntaṃ gamaṃ caiva tu |
vinyaset hastena dharmādibhirmantrayet || 16 ||

dharmajñānañca vairāgyamaiśvaryañcaiva (*) tmakam | 
karṇikāyai namo'ntañca mantrāṇāñca smaran guruḥ || 17 ||

mūrdhni madhye viśeṣeṇa vinyasettu vicakṣaṇaḥ |
abhimantritapuṃsañca jñānakhaḍgañca saṅgṛhet || 18 ||

<p. 3>

astreṇa daśa saṃkhyābhiḥ abhimantreṇa buddhimān |
pañcagavyakrameṇaiva sādhayettu vicakṣaṇaḥ || 19 ||

prokṣayetpañcagavyena astramantraṃ samuccaran |
tadvaitañca viśeṣeṇa paridhānādyalaṅkṛtam || 20 ||

naijyadevāsanaṃ kalpyaṃ uttarābhimukhasthitaḥ |
nirīkṣaṇaprokṣaṇañcaiva tāṭanābhyukṣaṇaṃ tathā || 21 ||

khaḍgenoddhāraṇañcaiva pūraṇañca samīraṇam |
kuṭṭanaṃ secanañcaiva mārjanaṃ lepanaṃ tathā || 22 ||

kalārūpañca kalyātha trisūtrībandhanaṃ dṛḍham |
pū (*) nā rekhayā caiva catuṣpadvīni trikṣipet || 23 ||

vajrīkaraṇamevoktaṃ śambareṇa tu mantrataḥ |
phālacandanasiddhāsyaiḥ bhasmadūrvākṣatān kuśān || 24 ||

dravyapañca samādāya vikarānyastramuccaran |
kuśakūrcañca saṃgrāhya vardhanyā mūrdhni vinyaset || 25 ||

tadūrdhve sthaṇḍilaṃ kalpya toye hemādikumbhayet |
vāme tu varddhanīñcaiva paścimānanameva ca || 26 ||

vṛṣabhāya namontena kumbhe āsanamarcayet |
kumbhe mūrdhni ca vinyasya śivaṃ sāṅgañca pūjayet || 27 ||

vyālāsananamontañca vardhanyāñca calāsanam |
pāśupatāstramūrtī ca pūrvavaddhyānasaṃyutam || 28 ||

<p. 4>

[iti lalitāgama vacane pāśupatāstramantram] |

oṃ śrīṃ hrīṃ glīṃ klīṃ aiṃ sauṃ paśu huṃphaṭ svāhā |

iti pāśupatāstrāya namaḥ |

śrī sthalapāṇḍyan |

śrī sthalīśvarāya namaḥ || 
